    "en": {
      "name": "Hero Descent",
      "effect": "Special Summon up to 2 monsters whose total Levels equal 7 or lower, among the monsters in your Graveyard that are \"Neo-Spacian Aqua Dolphin\", \"Neo-Spacian Flare Scarab\", or Warrior Type Normal Monsters, to your field in face-up Defense Position This turn, you can only attack with Warrior Type monsters."
